From 711314efdf67c5f7f222261529e5276bd1dd1f85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:42:14 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(gcode): add camcraft-gcode crate for RS-274/ISO 6983
 3-axis milling

Implements pure-Rust 3-axis RS-274/NGC and ISO 6983 parsing into
`cl::Toolpath` sections and 1-based line maps depending only on
`camcraft-cl`, `camcraft-geometry`, and `thiserror`.

Includes dialect presets, modal group tracking, I/J/K and signed R arcs
in G17/G18/G19, canned cycle expansion (G73/G81/G82/G83/G84/G85/G86/G89
with G98/G99 and L repeats), tool-change section splits, G53/G28/G30
reference moves, named line-numbered refusals, pinning tests, xtask crate
list registration, and docs/decisions/2217-camcraft-gcode.md.

Part of #2217 (held before PR: upstream/main fails batch build on #2244)
